{"data":[{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2109712973229080576"]},"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-12T18:34:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109714218014667039"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/NEYTWgE2ul","end":304,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109714218014667039/video/1","media_key":"13_2109712973229080576","start":281,"url":"https://t.co/NEYTWgE2ul"},{"display_url":"x.com/emollick/statu…","end":328,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/emollick/status/2042040840554451286","start":305,"url":"https://t.co/X8sj3A0wG7"}]},"id":"2109714218014667039","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":15,"impression_count":28091,"like_count":197,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":23,"retweet_count":7},"text":"Had some early access to Muse Wonder, but did not get a chance to use it a ton, yet it seems like a good model from limited test\n\nPerhaps more impressive, compare the progress since April in my drowned neogothic city twigl shader test. Very fast progress from Meta in a short time https://t.co/NEYTWgE2ul https://t.co/X8sj3A0wG7","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109714218014667039"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109712156333920256"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T18:25:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109712165011890520"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":202,"id":"1980807777548218370","start":191,"username":"DanKatzIMF"}],"urls":[{"description":"Enjoy the videos and music you love, upload original content, and share it all with friends, family, and the world on YouTube.","display_url":"youtube.com/live/iGGEgcQGh…","end":239,"expanded_url":"https://youtube.com/live/iGGEgcQGhDc?feature=share","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109099000699994112/K6qjtUtv?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109099000699994112/K6qjtUtv?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":216,"status":200,"title":"Mitigating Sovereign Risks in Market-Access Countries","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/live/iGGEgcQGhDc?feature=share","url":"https://t.co/E2FuA44OV0"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/qS8XqYy72E","end":263,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109712165011890520/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109712156333920256","start":240,"url":"https://t.co/qS8XqYy72E"}]},"id":"2109712165011890520","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":9871,"like_count":25,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":5},"text":"What will it take to strengthen resilience and preserve market access in a more demanding global environment? Join tomorrow’s discussion, moderated by Rodrigo Valdés, with opening remarks by @DanKatzIMF. Watch live: https://t.co/E2FuA44OV0 https://t.co/qS8XqYy72E","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109712165011890520"},{"author_id":"1214528593","created_at":"2026-10-12T17:53:46.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109704092620816515"],"id":"2109704092620816515","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":2800,"like_count":23,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I'm not sure to what extent Meta is optimizing for AI power users as a customer base, but FWIW, some feedback from that POV - it'd be useful to have more transparency into model use\n\nE.g. I signed up for a Maximum account but don't know if/where I'm actually using Wonder Full","url":"https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2109704092620816515"},{"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-12T16:31:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109683365045739888"],"id":"2109683365045739888","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":87,"impression_count":25970,"like_count":475,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":72,"retweet_count":33},"text":"If you haven’t made sure to turn on two-factor authentication on all accounts, have passwords with family in case you get voice calls asking for money, etc, now would be a good time.\n\nAI gains mean the costs of mass targeting individuals with sophisticated attacks are dropping.","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109683365045739888"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109630171934543872"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T13:00:49.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109630368735531036"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/vDwi0EWlMd","end":286,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109630368735531036/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109630171934543872","start":263,"url":"https://t.co/vDwi0EWlMd"}]},"id":"2109630368735531036","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":13047,"like_count":69,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":16},"text":"SAVE THE DATE: Debt is high. Borrowing costs are rising. What does it mean for public finances worldwide? Join IMF Fiscal Affairs Director Rodrigo Valdés for a press briefing on fiscal policy in today's context. Oct. 14 at 9:00 AM UTC+7 (Oct. 13 at 10:00 PM EST) https://t.co/vDwi0EWlMd","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109630368735531036"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109611335369564160"]},"author_id":"321536046","created_at":"2026-10-12T11:45:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109611346811625689"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":37,"id":"16561802","start":27,"username":"nabe_econ"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/Wfd685wdqx","end":146,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2109611346811625689/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109611335369564160","start":123,"url":"https://t.co/Wfd685wdqx"}]},"id":"2109611346811625689","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":826,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"We are in Cleveland at the @nabe_econ annual meeting until tomorrow! Stop by our booth to learn more about BEA statistics. https://t.co/Wfd685wdqx","url":"https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2109611346811625689"},{"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T10:00:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109584943810855152"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"Per Jacobsson Foundation Lecture: Inside the Event Horizon","d