:14},"text":"🔴 LIVE NOW:  #IMFInspired is underway with @KGeorgieva, @SabinaBhatia01, and @ayeshakhanna1. Join us for a timely conversation on AI’s impact on economies and work, and the importance of empowering women and girls in the digital age. \n\nWatch: https://t.co/owqL5oIDHm","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109569837823676435"},{"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T08:59:56.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109569749931958460"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"IMF Inspired","display_url":"x.com/i/broadcasts/1…","end":36,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1MKgNbqYaXwxL","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109569752444366848/MwQoUJ4A?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2109569752444366848/MwQoUJ4A?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":13,"status":200,"title":"IMF","unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/broadcasts/1MKgNbqYaXwxL","url":"https://t.co/owqL5oIDHm"}]},"id":"2109569749931958460","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":14,"impression_count":21393,"like_count":72,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":8,"retweet_count":22},"text":"IMF Inspired https://t.co/owqL5oIDHm","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109569749931958460"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109550285840642048"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109550295856615914"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"This event will be live streamed on this page. Refresh the browser at the start of event to load video player New quantity-based indicators measure financial repression across 17 advanced economies since 1920. Repression peaked after WWII, receded with liberalization, and has risen since the GFC, generating measurable fiscal","display_url":"imfconnect.org/content/imf/en…","end":227,"expanded_url":"https://www.imfconnect.org/content/imf/en/annual-meetings/calendar/open/2026/10/12/212364.html","start":204,"status":200,"title":"Analytical Corner: The Coming Great Repression? New Measures and a Century of Evidence","unwound_url":"https://www.imfconnect.org/content/imf/en/annual-meetings/calendar/open/2026/10/12/212364.html","url":"https://t.co/NtqOysRXmk"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/pDzXI85b7R","end":251,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109550295856615914/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109550285840642048","start":228,"url":"https://t.co/pDzXI85b7R"}]},"id":"2109550295856615914","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":14269,"like_count":29,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":3,"retweet_count":8},"text":"WATCH LIVE: How has financial repression evolved over a century? New indicators for 17 advanced economies show a postwar peak, a retreat with liberalization, and a rise since the global financial crisis: https://t.co/NtqOysRXmk https://t.co/pDzXI85b7R","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109550295856615914"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109550068810567680"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T07:42:07.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109550163450798207"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":249,"start":237,"tag":"IMFMeetings"}],"urls":[{"description":"This event will be live streamed on this page. Refresh the browser at the start of event to load video player Drawing on millions of online job postings from across Asia, this presentation offers some of the first evidence on how AI is reshaping labor markets in the region and raises pressing questions for policymakers about how workers and labor markets will adapt to AI-driven","display_url":"imfconnect.org/content/imf/en…","end":236,"expanded_url":"https://www.imfconnect.org/content/imf/en/annual-meetings/calendar/open/2026/10/12/212361.html","start":213,"status":200,"title":"Analytical Corner: Labor Markets in Asia: Challenges and Opportunities in the Age of AI","unwound_url":"https://www.imfconnect.org/content/imf/en/annual-meetings/calendar/open/2026/10/12/212361.html","url":"https://t.co/xOvhclRLPk"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/kbCUcTOVOd","end":273,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109550163450798207/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109550068810567680","start":250,"url":"https://t.co/kbCUcTOVOd"}]},"id":"2109550163450798207","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":11973,"like_count":25,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":8},"text":"WATCH LIVE: How is AI reshaping Asia’s labor markets? Drawing on millions of online job postings, Divya Kirti presents some of the first regional evidence—and the questions it raises for workers and policymakers. https://t.co/xOvhclRLPk #IMFMeetings https://t.co/kbCUcTOVOd","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109550163450798207"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109533409580023808"]},"author_id":"332617373","created_at":"2026-10-12T06:35:33.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109533414223450179"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":137,"start":129,"tag":"economy"},{"end":146,"start":138,"tag":"markets"},{"end":153,"start":147,"tag":"bonds"},{"end":161,"start":154,"tag":"yields"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JSRcursLeG","end":185,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/elerianm/status/2109533414223450179/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109533409580023808","start":162,"url":"https://t.co/JSRcursLeG"}]},"id":"2109533414223450179","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":11,"impression_count":26044,"like_count":224,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":35,"retweet_count":56},"text":"Good morning.\nWhere do G-7 sovereign yields stand entering the new week?\nHere’s the 10-year government debt lineup from the WSJ.\n#economy #markets #bonds #yields https://t.co/JSRcursLeG","url":"https://x.com/elerianm/status/2109533414223450179"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109516921549004800"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T05:30:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109516925781017010"],"entities":{"hashtags":[{"end":263,"start":251,"tag":"IMFMeetings"}],"urls":[{"description":"Enjoy the videos and music you love, upload original content, and share it all with friends, family, and the world on YouTube.","display_url":"youtube.com/live/uoyOGMnGA…","end":250,"expanded_url":"https://www.youtube.com/live/uoyOGMnGAzM?si=NGItJ2WWEiKxqYQ3","images":[{"height":720,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108535474696708096/aYOcy3UD?format=jpg&name=orig","width":1280},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2108535474696708096/aYOcy3UD?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":227,"status":200,"title":"Press Briefing European Department","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/live/uoyOGMnGAzM?si=NGItJ2WWEiKxqYQ3","url":"https://t.co/yEiCEWPj5M"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/06XZ3cRw4Y","end":287,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109516925781017010/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109516921549004800","start":264,"url":"https://t.co/06XZ3cRw4Y"}]},"id":"2109516925781017010","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":9,"impression_count":15122,"like_count":49,"quote_count":2,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":15},"text":"What’s the outlook for Europe’s economy? Join Mateusz Szczurek, Director of the IMF’s European Department, for the launch of the latest Regional Economic Outlook for Europe on Friday, October 16, at 5:00 p.m. UTC+7 Watch live: https://t.co/yEiCEWPj5M #IMFMeetings https://t.co/06XZ3cRw4Y","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109516925781017010"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109505639248695296"]},"author_id":"1214528593","created_at":"2026-10-12T04:45:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109505643648537072"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":103,"id":"1350226874","start":93,"username":"lfschiavo"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/KbIgk004kR","end":127,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2109505643648537072/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109505639248695296","start":104,"url":"https://t.co/KbIgk004kR"}]},"id":"2109505643648537072","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":12396,"like_count":222,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":7,"retweet_count":1},"text":"Pan’s Labyrinth 20th Anniversary Edition is v good\n\nAlso I am a lucky guy, happy anniversary @lfschiavo https://t.co/KbIgk004kR","url":"https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2109505643648537072"},{"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-12T04:25:42.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109500734207373434"],"id":"2109500734207373434","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":21,"impression_count":31156,"like_count":547,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":90,"retweet_count":7},"text":"It has become disheartening that the average replybot on this site has shifted its replyslop angle to asking interesting questions.\n\nIt feels like actual intellectual engagement, which makes it somehow worse than just rephrasing the post with a \"that's the part people miss\" bit.","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109500734207373434"},{"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-12T04:14:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109497942717632662"],"id":"2109497942717632662","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":74,"impression_count":40873,"like_count":651,"quote_count":10,"reply_count":122,"retweet_count":19},"text":"GPT-6 Pro finds supposed errors in academic papers all the time, just as part of other work. Confirming the errors &amp; learning their importance would still take a lot of time today, but it will get faster. We don't have the right mechanisms in place to deal a flood of corrections.","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109497942717632662"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109494278431141888"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-12T04:00:12.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109494317710737821"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/FvHTFBrRzx","end":281,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109494317710737821/photo/1","media_key":"3_2109494278431141888","start":258,"url":"https://t.co/FvHTFBrRzx"}]},"id":"2109494317710737821","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":6,"impression_count":14849,"like_count":57,"quote_count":3,"reply_count":4,"retweet_count":21},"text":"Can technology help accelerate growth, productivity, and economic diversification across emerging and developing economies? Join us on Oct 14 at 5 PM UTC+7 for a discussion on how AI, fintech and digital infrastructure can support prosperity and resilience. https://t.co/FvHTFBrRzx","url":"https://x.com/IMFNews/status/2109494317710737821"},{"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-12T02:32:32.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109472254417318335"],"id":"2109472254417318335","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":91,"impression_count":57954,"like_count":647,"quote_count":14,"reply_count":142,"retweet_count":17},"text":"I spoke to some annoyed leaders at big firms who were still big on GPTs as of last month, before GPTs were sunsetted. Yes, GPTs outlived their usefulness. But large organizations have complex planning &amp; all the Labs (not just OpenAI) keep making sudden changes that confuse them.","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109472254417318335"},{"author_id":"39125788","created_at":"2026-10-11T23:14:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109422437616029941"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/karpathy/statu…","end":316,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/karpathy/status/2109361546505966046","start":293,"url":"https://t.co/HHydK3UBij"}]},"id":"2109422437616029941","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":139,"impression_count":46931,"like_count":994,"quote_count":5,"reply_count":97,"retweet_count":45},"text":"Not to get too annoying about it but its worth noting that many of the 5,000 people at the labs with access to advanced model still haven't used them to their full extent: its all cybersecurity &amp;  math &amp; AI R&amp;D.\n\nThere are a lot of other fields to advance and problems to solve... https://t.co/HHydK3UBij","url":"https://x.com/emollick/status/2109422437616029941"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2109415003761811456"]},"author_id":"25098482","created_at":"2026-10-11T22:45:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2109415012481880215"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":43,"id":"1